		<title type="html"><![CDATA[[ADVICE NEEDED] DMTF alpha keys order changes.]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=296&amp;p=2054#p2054"><![CDATA[
Hi all,<br><br>    Modifying some code, I found the DTMF alpha keys have a strange mapping.<br><br>Currently it is mapped like this:<br><strong class="text-strong">A:</strong><em class="text-italics">&lt;LEFT&gt;</em> <strong class="text-strong">B:</strong><em class="text-italics">&lt;RIGHT&gt;</em> <strong class="text-strong">C:</strong><em class="text-italics">&lt;UP&gt;</em> <strong class="text-strong">D:</strong><em class="text-italics">&lt;DOWN&gt;</em><br><br>So, I think a more logical mapping can be defined as the following:<br>1) <strong class="text-strong">A:</strong><em class="text-italics">&lt;LEFT&gt;</em> <strong class="text-strong">B:</strong><em class="text-italics">&lt;UP&gt;</em> <strong class="text-strong">C:</strong><em class="text-italics">&lt;DOWN&gt;</em> <strong class="text-strong">D:</strong><em class="text-italics">&lt;RIGHT&gt;</em><br><br>or, circular one:<br>2) <strong class="text-strong">A:</strong><em class="text-italics">&lt;LEFT&gt;</em> <strong class="text-strong">B:</strong><em class="text-italics">&lt;UP&gt;</em> <strong class="text-strong">C:</strong><em class="text-italics">&lt;RIGHT&gt;</em> <strong class="text-strong">D:</strong><em class="text-italics">&lt;DOWN&gt;</em><br><br><br>Do you have any opinion ?<br><br>Cheers.<br>---<br>Daniel<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=56">F1RMB</a> — Mon Dec 09, 2019 2:53 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
